Package: hologramagent-toolchain
Version: VERSION_PLACEHOLDER
Architecture: ARCH_PLACEHOLDER
Maintainer: HologramAgent Team <team@hologramagent.ai>
Installed-Size: INSTALLED_SIZE_PLACEHOLDER
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.28), libstdc++6, libgcc-s1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/trueagent/HologramAgent
Description: HologramAgent Toolchain (Daemon + CLI + Plugin Toolchain + SDK)
 HologramAgent is a personal AI home assistant that integrates
 large language models with system automation.
 .
 This package includes the full development toolchain:
  - homed: the core daemon (background service, onnxruntime enabled)
  - depgraph.bin: kernel startup dependency graph (MUST sit next to homed)
  - waiter: command-line client
  - hmapdev: plugin build toolchain (init/build/package .hmap)
  - the matching HologramAgent SDK (sdk/, tools/, skills/, meta/, docs/)
 .
 Installs the SDK under /usr/lib/hologram/sdk so that hmapdev can resolve
 plugins against a known-good SDK without network access.
